sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 Usuario
    participant Frontend as 🌐 Frontend
    participant AppAPI as 🟠 Appliances API
    participant PredictionAPI as 🟡 Prediction API
    participant ConAPI as 🔵 Consumption API
    participant PostgreSQL as 🗄️ PostgreSQL

    User->>Frontend: Registra AC (5000W)
    Frontend->>AppAPI: POST /api/v1/appliances<br/>{type: "AC", power: 5000}
    AppAPI->>AppAPI: Clasifica dispositivo
    AppAPI->>ConAPI: GET /api/v1/consumption/historical<br/>{last_30_days}
    ConAPI-->>AppAPI: {consumption_history}
    AppAPI->>PredictionAPI: POST /predict/monthly<br/>{appliance_data,<br/>historical_consumption}
    PredictionAPI->>PredictionAPI: Ejecuta ML Model
    PredictionAPI-->>AppAPI: {prediction: 150kWh/mes,<br/>confidence: 0.92}
    AppAPI->>PostgreSQL: INSERT appliances
    PostgreSQL-->>AppAPI: ✓ Stored
    AppAPI-->>Frontend: {appliance_id, prediction,<br/>cost_projection: $21.30}
    Frontend-->>User: ✓ AC registrado
